            "accordion_heading": "Overview",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<p>Give your dog the ultimate comfort with the <strong>Cloud Dog Bed</strong>. Featuring a half-bolster pillow and a spacious flat mattress, it offers soft headrest support and plenty of room for your dog to stretch out. Engineered with orthopaedic foam and cooling gel memory foam, this bed provides joint support without the firmness of traditional bolster beds. Its low-profile design ensures small and medium dogs can easily hop on and off</p><p>The <strong>Cloud Bed in Buttercream Boucle</strong> exudes sophisticated elegance, crafted from a premium boucle fabric that’s both soft and durable. This luxurious texture adds a refined, cosy touch to your home while maintaining a modern and minimalist aesthetic. Its light, neutral tone effortlessly complements your decor, creating a serene, inviting retreat for your beloved dog.</p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 8
          }
        },
