          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Features",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<ul><li>Unlike other beds that are too firm and designed for larger, heavier dogs, our Cloud Bed strikes the perfect balance between soft and orthopaedic support. </li><li>It’s soft enough for lighter dogs to rest their heads on, while providing premium joint support for a truly restful sleep experience.</li><li>The unique design provides enough space to sprawl out, while offering a half-bolster pillow made from shredded memory foam</li><li>CertiPUR-US certified foam with a cooling gel memory foam topper</li><li>Machine washable cover</li><li>Upholstery Boucle fabric</li><li>OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified</li></ul>",
